1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:02,273
This is RootCause.

2
00:00:02,273 --> 00:00:03,606
It is not a case log.

3
00:00:03,606 --> 00:00:08,830
It reads the evidence you attach, challenges your first guess, and names what to fix next.

4
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:12,308
It opens blank, on your own cases, in this browser.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,961
Start with what happened: a porosity cluster at the bearing boss of a die-cast pump housing.

6
00:00:18,961 --> 00:00:22,558
Line four, batch B-7781.

7
00:00:22,558 --> 00:00:25,494
Your first guess is ejector-pin over-travel.

8
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:32,010
Attach what you already have: the loupe image, the sensor window, and the batch record.

9
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:34,793
The app reads the numbers, not just the text.

10
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:39,977
Cavity vacuum rose fifty-seven percent across the shift.

11
00:00:39,977 --> 00:00:43,975
Hydrogen is 1.9 ppm against a 1.4 limit.

12
00:00:43,975 --> 00:00:49,588
RootCause ranks gas porosity at eighty-six percent, and puts your ejector-pin guess below it.

13
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:52,584
That is the disagreement.

14
00:00:52,584 --> 00:00:57,218
The crack starts below the surface; the ejector marks are on the opposite face.

15
00:00:57,218 --> 00:01:00,791
The app shows why the first guess is weak and what would prove it wrong.

16
00:01:02,490 --> 00:01:05,800
Accept the evidence-backed cause, then sign the report.

17
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:09,008
The ranking, the reason and the sign-off are recorded.

18
00:01:09,008 --> 00:01:14,727
The app also names the prevention checks: die venting, the door seal, and the rest of the batch.

19
00:01:16,430 --> 00:01:20,354
The signed report carries the evidence, the signals and the files.

20
00:01:20,354 --> 00:01:23,089
This is the deliverable the quality system keeps.

21
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:28,877
Admin switches between your workspace and the synthetic reference workspace.

22
00:01:28,877 --> 00:01:30,280
Both are clearly labelled.

23
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,344
Your case is still here when you come back.

24
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,201
Evidence first.

25
00:01:35,201 --> 00:01:36,686
The engineer decides.

26
00:01:36,686 --> 00:01:37,877
That's RootCause.
